For interview
@SpringBootConfiguration identifies the main configuration class,
@ComponentScan scans packages and creates beans,
@EnableAutoConfiguration automatically configures beans based on project dependencies and properties.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Basic annotations for spring boot:
_______________________________________________________________________________
|Annotation                |   Purpose                                        |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@SpringBootApplication    |   Start point of the app                         |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@ComponentScan            |   Finds the classes that are able to create      |
|                          |   objects and stores it in a spring container    |
|                          |   this is reffered to as beans                   |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@EnableAutoConfiguration  |   Configure beans based on the dependencies added|
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@SpringBootConfiguration  |   Finds the main Config class                    |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@Component                |   spring creates an object                       |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@Service                  |   Used for writing business logic                |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@RestController           |   handles http request and sends data directly to|
|                          |   the client/browser,It is a combination of      |
|                          |   @Controller and @ResponseBody                  |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@Controller               |   handles http request and returns the html/view |
|                          |   page                                           |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@ResponseBody             |   Sends the data in HTTP response                |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@GetMapping               |   Handles HTTP GET Request                       |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@RequestMapping           |   Base URL                                       |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@PathVariable             |   Gets a value from the URL path                 |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@RequestParam             |   Gets a value from the URL query                |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@Autowired                |   Spring automatically injects the objects       |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|@Value                    |   Reads value from application properties or yml |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|CommandLineRunner         |   Runs on start                                  |
|_____________________________________________________________________________|
